        "TileImage": "$($repository 1675d777-037c-4300-ac9e-aabd9da59d02).Image",
        "Description": "[This briefing has been sent as a part of the emergency duty program]\r\rGood day, agent. It seems like you have been wrongly pronounced dead by exposure to low temperatures and put in a morgue of a local high-end clinic. \rWhile you&apos;re there, make sure to get rid of some &quot;Unwanted Elements&quot; by setting up accidents, to ensure your legend stays safe and sound. You also should not be seen by anyone, including cameras and do not touch any patients or staff, after all, &quot;you&apos;ve never been there&quot;.",
